        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana WP27, 6\" Utility Pull Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of solid brass, this Early American styled pull handle is great for cabinets, drawers, furniture, utility doors, or pantry doors. The Solid Brass 6 Inch Utility Pull Handle is surface mounted to the face of the door in the classic, early american style. Comes packaged with matching finish screws for easy installation. Available in 8 different finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-WP27-size.gif?v=1704354613\" width=\"600\" height=\"106\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana WP27 Early American Cabinet Pull Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-4-inch-early-american-cabinet-pull-deltana-wp026\"><b>4\" Early American Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana WP27 Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Plate Height: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance:1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection:1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/WP27.pdf?v=1691095377\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana WP27 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose, the cabinet handle will still be <b>high quality solid brass</b>. \r\n</p>",
