                "title": "Solid Brass 6 Inch Utility Pull Handle | Deltana WP27",
                "description": "Deltana WP27 - Made of solid brass, this Early American styled pull handle is great for cabinets, drawers, furniture, utility doors, or pantry doors. The Solid Brass 6 Inch Utility Pull Handle is surface mounted to the face of the door in the classic, early american style. Comes packaged with matching finish screws for easy installation. Available in 8 different finishes.",
